+  // SDP: Collect pointer types on the unoptimized IR, before any transform
+  // runs. The pass self-gates on the fcount_allptrtype / fcount_sptrtype module
+  // flags, so it is a no-op unless -fcount-allptrtype / -fcount-sptrtype is set
